0	string		gimp\ xcf	GIMP XCF image data,
!:mime	image/x-xcf
!:ext	xcf
>9	string		file		version 0,
>9	string		v		version
>>10	string		>\0		%s,
>14	belong		x		%u x
>18	belong		x		%u,
>22     belong          0               RGB Color
